  "why": "No written column on a town's plan or outside its reach (tools/town_dressing.py Mask), on painted water or within 4 of a painted tree, within water_changed_reach of a column the pending water export changes (the owner, 2026-09-28: nothing built that the export would invalidate), or near another system's pieces (dressing, working Pokemon); in the Displaced City's cavern, clear of its trees, lights and tunnel (derived/cavern/plan.json, the cavern's 40_light function); faces face_gap apart"
 },
